cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and repository."
title: "reflexive-options"
abstract: >-
  A fixed-equilibrium local physical-measure model of dealer-gamma feedback,
  with an inward-pointing variance boundary, analytic local Hopf conditions,
  actual-nonlinearity and signed-mixture robustness audits, and a pre-extraction
  sign-agnostic open-interest proxy protocol.
